verdict = "task"
evidence = "docs/wiki/BetaCluster.md:58 still gives `paxd start --home /var/lib/paxeer` and docs/wiki/BetaCluster.md:120-121 places the 40Gi data PVC at `/var/lib/paxeer`, whereas services/platform/hosted/paxeer/deployment.yaml:74 runs `python3 /opt/layerx/kernel_runtime.py --home /data/layerx/node`, services/platform/hosted/paxeer/deployment.yaml:85 mounts data at `/data` and services/platform/hosted/paxeer/deployment.yaml:121 retains 40Gi; commit e3c7244ad7269e76d61d308bde5a0dc4eb5bf5a7 corrected docs/wiki/PaxeerBoundary.md:73,75 but left those BetaCluster claims intact, and services/platform/hosted/paxeer/repair_m483_test.go:42-47 checks that the boundary command matches the maintained native runtime."
close_comment = "BetaCluster still describes an outdated primary command and volume path. A documentation correction is specified to describe `python3 /opt/layerx/kernel_runtime.py --home /data/layerx/node` and the 40Gi data volume mounted at `/data`, matching the manifest and PaxeerBoundary."

